<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Vodafone cut at Hoare Govett.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vodafone cut at Hoare Govett.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vodafone Plc was lowered to &quot;undervalued&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at ABN AMRO Hoare Govett following its strong gains since the start of January, market sources said on Tuesday. Analysts at Hoare Govett said they remained positive on the long-term outlook for the company but scaled back their recommendation to reflect its near 20 percent rise so far this year.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 287-1/2p.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
